#: scenario2:scenario2_E3B8080E_64F4_494C_8748_E633AB9B7B86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18064d49b9a0efc710958b4c3099e38545925d5bebbddf2137da1a36bac4081e
