#: scenario2:scenario2_7CC04AB0_BDC5_4F3D_BD21_1CD11CB78737
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 495f1b6468774c70ebe4348d396f3324b46601fafdcdd0da0796227d817acb53
