#: scenario2:scenario2_14B4EFA8_4CDC_4E77_9678_C64085275876
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4e2fbcb29eacc2d6d5998f44b30624074a77847a556145878210d5bc655e461
